OL,3,GNEWSAThe druid, the weather presenter
OL,4,Aand the astronomer - when does autumn
OL,5,Astart?
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, in the ancient Celtic calendar
OL,8,Fwe've already been in autumn since 1
OL,9,FAugust.
